WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.752
Run the schema exploration query first.

00:00:02.752 --> 00:00:06.437
Look at objects in the public and analytics schemas.

00:00:06.437 --> 00:00:09.437
The public schema contains source tables.

00:00:09.437 --> 00:00:13.247
The analytics schema contains reusable interfaces.

00:00:13.247 --> 00:00:18.357
This separation is helpful because object location can communicate purpose.

00:00:18.357 --> 00:00:22.362
Choose the smallest reusable object that matches the need.

00:00:22.362 --> 00:00:27.807
A CTE is local to one query, a view centralizes live logic,

00:00:27.807 --> 00:00:31.107
and a materialized view persists a snapshot.

00:00:31.107 --> 00:00:36.822
Promote logic into shared objects when it is stable, reused, and worth governing as part of the analytical

00:00:36.822 --> 00:00:38.638
architecture.
